<style>
  .card p {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--clr-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .card p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .quote-box {
    background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(var(--clr-accent-rgb), 0.1), transparent);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--clr-accent);
    padding: 24px;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .quote-box svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--clr-accent);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .quote-box p {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--clr-text);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>

<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>My Journey So Far</h2>
      <div class="underline"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p>
        I'm currently pursuing my
        <span class="highlight">Bachelor Human-IT at ENSEA de Cergy (95)</span>,
        focusing on information technologies and their impact on society.
        My experiences span infrastructure migration (Docker to
        LXC/Waydroid), Python/Bash automation scripting, and full stack
        development.
      </p>
      <div class="quote-box">
        <!-- prettier-ignore -->
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path>
        </svg>
        <p>
          "Fuelled by curiosity, committed to quality, inspired by
          technology."
        </p>
      </div>
      <p>
        My passion lies in automation and building concrete end-to-end
        solutions — from Linux server deployment to full stack web
        applications. I love turning complex infrastructure and software
        challenges into clean, working systems.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
